        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Tyrannosaur\n- People: Paddy Considine, Peter Mullan, Olivia Colman, Eddie Marsan, Paul Popplewell, Sally Carman\n- Roles: director, writer, actress\n- Awards: BAFTA Awards, BIFA Awards, Golden Globe Award, Emmy Award\n\nFacts:\n- Olivia Colman was born as Sarah Caroline Olivia Colman on 30 January 1974, and she is an English actress.\n- Tyrannosaur is a 2011 British drama film.\n- Tyrannosaur was written and directed by Paddy Considine in his directorial debut.\n- Tyrannosaur stars Peter Mullan, Olivia Colman, Eddie Marsan, Paul Popplewell, and Sally Carman.\n- Olivia Colman has won three BAFTA Awards, three BIFA Awards, and one Golden Globe Award.\n- Olivia Colman has also received two Emmy Award nominations.",
